===============================================================================
WHAT THIS COVERS
===============================================================================

Everything in this repository that is the copyright holder's to license: the
code, the styling, the SQL schema, the tournament data files, the written
recaps and event descriptions, and the artwork and logos made for the site.

This is a hobby project about a backyard tournament. If you want to fork it,
copy the scoring model, lift the layout, or run your own decathlon off the back
of it, go ahead - that is what the MIT license is for. No attribution beyond
keeping the notice above is expected.

The "AS IS" paragraph is the point of this license as much as the permission
grant is. Nothing here is warranted, nothing here is advice, and the copyright
holder accepts no liability for anything that happens as a result of using it.


===============================================================================
