===============================================================================

These are not restrictions being added on top of the MIT grant. They are limits
on what any copyright license is capable of transferring in the first place.

1. PHOTOGRAPHS OF PEOPLE. The tournament photos show identifiable private
   individuals. Copyright in the images is licensed above, but a person's right
   to control commercial use of their own name, face and likeness belongs to
   them and cannot be signed away by someone else. Reuse the photos for your
   own project and that is between you and the people in them. Any participant
   may ask for a photo to be removed from this site at any time, and it will be,
   without discussion.

2. THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL. The page template in assets/ is "Stellar" by HTML5 UP,
   used under CC BY 3.0. Its license travels with it - see
